    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helen Keller Simulator</strong> is an experimental exploration game where you navigate a world without sight or sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no visuals and no audio cues, you must rely entirely on whatever you stumble upon.<br>Let subtle tooltips guide you as you collect items, avoid unseen dangers, and traverse unfamiliar environments with no clear map or direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new area is only revealed as you find it, challenging your sense of space, memory, and orientation. Death is possible, and progress depends on learning how to feel your way through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about winning or a linear story.\u00a0 It\u2019s an abstract, difficult experience meant to immerse you in an unfamiliar way of perceiving a world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helen Keller Simulator</strong> is an experimental exploration game where you navigate a world without sight or sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no visuals and no audio cues, you must rely entirely on whatever you stumble upon.<br>Let subtle tooltips guide you as you collect items, avoid unseen dangers, and traverse unfamiliar environments with no clear map or direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new area is only revealed as you find it, challenging your sense of space, memory, and orientation. Death is possible, and progress depends on learning how to feel your way through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about winning or a linear story.\u00a0 It\u2019s an abstract, difficult experience meant to immerse you in an unfamiliar way of perceiving a world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a world without your eyes and ears to guide you. Uncover the secrets this world has to offer, hoard all the items you can find or get lost trying.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
